#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:maintenance_equipment_usability.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Number of months the equipment stays usable after its latest passed "
"maintenance result. Validity extends to the end of the target month (e.g. "
"passed on 15 June with 13 months stays usable until 31 July of the following "
"year)."
msgstr ""
"最後の合格結果から、設備が使用可能であり続ける月数。有効期限は対象月の月末まで"
"延長されます（例：6月15日に合格・13ヶ月なら翌年7月31日まで使用可能）。"

